/// into a minion and he is scared (respawn, lost progress). P20 R130: go straight to gw 2d before bookgs 0xa0.
// R129: no second 22/23/24 snack walk after 0xa3: those snacks are eaten (no refill) and the walk crosses the
// obj_launcher_level5 0x2a800038 throws at 268.6,239.3 (courage 0.4 -> 0, respawn); 28/29/2a then the 0x9d boss
// R129 NODESET: the gw 2d walk after 0x9f stops on Scooby at 250.8,248.2; a goto 247 252 first, then gw 2d.
